<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There is a place where Jesus sheds</l><l>The oil of gladness on our heads,</l><l>A place than all besides more sweet—</l><l>It is the blood-bought mercy seat.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>There is a scene where spirits blend,</l><l>Where friend holds fellowship with friend;</l><l>Though sundered far, by faith they meet</l><l>Around one common mercy seat.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>There, there on eagle’s wings we soar,</l><l>And time and sense seem all no more,</l><l>And heaven comes down our souls to greet,</l><l>And glory crowns the mercy seat.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
